  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Alternative Voices in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to contribute to enhancing alternative voices in BiH through media activism. Through its media activities CID will provide a different perspective and critical interpretation of the current economic and political situation in the country. Its goal is to draw attention to the acute problems of this society, which are being ignored by mainstream media or exploited in manipulative ways, which is why BiH political and social reality is becoming more totalitarian.</narrative>
  </description>
